**The prompt-side half:** `briefs/audit-beta.md` (A1/A2/A4),
`briefs/audit-alpha.md` (A6/A8) and `briefs/audit-orchestrator.md` (A3/A9),
each opening with the no-shell-permission rule and carrying the triage rule
