research/audit/wave6-certifier-tasks/cex-limsup-infinite-not-attained-in-r.md-412-behaviour of the sequence is invisible to $\operatorname{SL}(x)$ and is recorded
research/audit/wave6-certifier-tasks/cex-limsup-infinite-not-attained-in-r.md-413-only by $\overline{\operatorname{SL}}(x)$ ([[def-extended-limits]]).
