research/audit/wave6-dispatch/certifier-cex-limsup-infinite-not-attained-in-r.prompt.md-470-
research/audit/wave6-dispatch/certifier-cex-limsup-infinite-not-attained-in-r.prompt.md-471-[L1] The alternating sequence: $|s_k| = 1$, $s_{e_j} = 1$, $s_{o_j} = -1$, and $e$, $o$ are strictly increasing, so $e_j \ge j$ and $o_j \ge j$ ([[lem-alternating-sequence]], [[lem-index-map-grows]]).
