research/audit/wave6-alpha.md-48-- **Contract/risk surface:** the strict contract gate confirms 1,163 manifest dependency edges have current exact source-section quotes and complete fact-to-step mappings. The risk router identifies 74 critical and 19 high items (93 mandatory independent reads), plus 8 moderate and 5 ordinary contracts. Because the DeepSeek lane returned no reading, all 93 required `risk_review` records remain deliberately incomplete.
research/audit/wave6-alpha.md-49-- **Manifest reconciliation in progress:** all 1,390 generated rows are accounted for by evidence mode: 1,163 exact proof-contract citations, 180 other current body uses, 13 declared metadata-only dependencies, and 34 orientation-only forward references. The current batches contain no cross-batch edge; the checklist has 987 published-backward edges and two forward references leaving the current batches. Full Alpha semantic disposition is not claimed while the mandatory adversarial reads are absent.
